{"4684790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vossarium", "steam_appid": 4684790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4857700], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684790/extras/15a0616dfd81ddb3e19f9f06a1dbd7b0.avif?t=1787594344\" width=200 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mira Voss called her mother and heard a scream. She doesn't remember what came after, only that she woke up inside Vossarium, a private neurological facility that already knows her name.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Something in the walls is humming. It's been humming for years. And somewhere in this building, in a room is the reason you were always going to end up here.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>VOSSARIUM is a first-person horror game about what we bury and what buries us back.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684790/extras/d7b6cffa96d6d2c45e60bb7fa6f4c3eb.poster.avif?t=1787594344\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684790/extras/d7b6cffa96d6d2c45e60bb7fa6f4c3eb.webm?t=1787594344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684790/extras/d7b6cffa96d6d2c45e60bb7fa6f4c3eb.mp4?t=1787594344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684790/extras/9582437eebbcaa506c80572b81af9af1.avif?t=1787594344\" width=291 height=65 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deep, unsettling atmosphere</strong> that keeps you on your toes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A robot... deficient in smarts </strong>to accompany you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684790/extras/63cfe9852866ee710d3cd6f3e9a31e42.poster.avif?t=1787594344\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684790/extras/63cfe9852866ee710d3cd6f3e9a31e42.webm?t=1787594344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684790/extras/63cfe9852866ee710d3cd6f3e9a31e42.mp4?t=1787594344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind bending puzzles</strong> that challenge your perception of reality.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684790/extras/f94d5e13065798b951914f64288d930b.poster.avif?t=1787594344\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684790/extras/f94d5e13065798b951914f64288d930b.webm?t=1787594344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684790/extras/f94d5e13065798b951914f64288d930b.mp4?t=1787594344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your actions and decisions have impact</strong> on the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape the lab with a scarce set of tools.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seemingly impossible rooms </strong>featuring non-Euclidean geometry where the laws of physics no longer appl